<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Our doubts and fears are now all gone.</l><l>We’re for Thy purpose and Thy plan.</l><l>Whatever may befall us—</l><l>The Great I Am, we fully trust.</l><l>Where’er Thou wilt send us, we’ll go.</l><l>Whate’er Thou dispensed, we’ll outflow.</l><l>Beget, nourish, perfect, and build,</l><l>Till Thy divine plan is fulfilled.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We stand before Thee face to face,</l><l>Exhibit how we ran the race.</l><l>Now we’re not here with empty hands,</l><l>But filled with Jesus and Thy brands.</l><l>Thy love, and grace, and fellowship—</l><l>All for the Body, not for ’self’.</l><l>Threefold blessing for three-part man</l><l>Behold the blessings, here we stand!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
